From 5191d8e74f823bd7f8fe57fba4a85d295b4f3ac3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:48:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Strip deployment story and phase/draft scaffolding; ship a
 proper 15-page ARKlight site

- Remove .github/workflows/deploy.yml, docs/DEPLOY.md
- Remove phase-2 draft stubs and the draft() machinery across content/*.py
- Remove docs/PLAN.md, docs/CONTENT-STATUS.md, scripts/status.py, pages/active.py, content/compare.py
- Simplify pages/manifest.py to a flat 15-route list (no phase column)
- Simplify components/render.py, scripts/gen_site.py, scripts/check_content.py,
  scripts/postbuild.py, Makefile to match (no pitstop/release/dev1/dev2 split)
- Update docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/AUTHORING.md to match
- Verified: make build succeeds (15 pages, 0 errors, 0 warnings, sitemap/robots written)
